# Kubernetes

- Edit files listed in `k8s/README.md` only. Do not apply leftovers listed there.
- Apply `k8s/generated/` after `scripts/render-k8s.sh` (placeholders from `config/site.env`).
- MFE `API_BASE` is `/api/v1` in staging and production.
- Service `selector` is `app: <name>` only.
- Built images: `{{REGISTRY_HOST}}/{{IMAGE_REPO}}/<name>:<tag>`. Stock images stay on Docker Hub / registry.k8s.io.
- Databases are host Docker on RED.
